; tiles.xon -- the kettle set drawn, for a windowed front-end: the dale
; above the Delve in a dry summer, the pit stopped.  Hedges and hay on
; the floor, heather, gritstone and bog on the hills, bare limestone at
; the rim; the town is the town set's (see data/town/art/tiles.xon).
;
; Read by the graphical front-end only; the form is the delve set's (see
; data/delve/art/tiles.xon and docs/graphics.md).  Colours here are named
; by letters; another file of this directory names its own by the rest.

(size 16 16)

(colour "." 0 0 0 0)
(colour "k" 16 13 12)
; gritstone, soot-dark in the town, weathered paler on the edges
(colour "d" 38 34 32)
